{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"Les Amandiers (Forever Young)","L’histoire se situe à la fin des années 1980. Stella, Victor, Adèle, Etienne et toute la troupe ont vingt ans. Ils passent le concours d’entrée de la célèbre école créée par Patrice Chéreau et Pierre Romans au Théâtre des Amandiers de Nanterre. Lancés à pleine vitesse dans la vie, la passion, le jeu, l’amour, ensemble ils vont vivre le tournant de leur vie mais aussi leur première tragédie. (At the end of the 1980s, Stella, Victor, Adèle and Etienne are 20 years old. They take the entrance exam to the famous acting school created by Patrice Chéreau and Pierre Romans at the Théâtre des Amandiers in Nanterre. Launched at full speed into life, passion, and love, together they will experience the turning point of their lives, but also their first tragedy.)",[4],"artistic creation",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":48,"media":51,"synopsis":54,"production":57,"characters":63,"roles":64,"awards":124,"tags":3},"Film","FR2022_167","fr2022-167-les-amandiers",{"native":10,"english":11},"Les Amandiers","Forever Young",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2022-11-16",2022,"Fiction film",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Valeria Bruni Tedeschi","valeria-bruni-tedeschi",1964,0,"Female identifying","France",[26,32,36,39,42,46],{"film":27,"year":28,"award":29,"category":30,"result":31},"i-villeggianti",2020,"Premio David di Donatello","Best Actress Female","Nominated",{"film":33,"year":34,"award":29,"category":30,"result":35},"it2016-006-la-pazza-gioia",2017,"Awarded",{"film":37,"year":38,"award":29,"category":30,"result":35},"it2014-009-il-capitale-umano",2014,{"film":40,"year":15,"award":41,"category":30,"result":31},"fr2021-095-la-fracture","César du cinéma",{"film":43,"year":44,"award":41,"category":45,"result":31}